    ValueError: If `num_mel_bins`/`num_spectrogram_bins`/`sample_rate` are not
      positive, `lower_edge_hertz` is negative, frequency edges are incorrectly
      ordered, `upper_edge_hertz` is larger than the Nyquist frequency.

